Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - Michael the Heartthrob}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.24,0:00:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.81,0:00:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As cheap as it can get!{安くしとくよ！then something}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.83,0:00:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! You little...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.72,0:00:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that thieving cat!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.97,0:00:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd that thieving cat come from?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.31,0:00:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If he comes back again, \NI'll slice him open for sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.12,0:00:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.09,0:00:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You little...{I get that these people are Yazuka(?) but I feel this is still kinda extreme for what's basically a kids show... what about "You little..."? -Marty} {you little work fine, yes}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.71,0:01:05.57,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Michael's day begins with stealing fish...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.57,0:01:10.20,Narrator,,0,0,0,,No, pardon me, \Nwith some light exercise.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.87,0:01:18.51,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Well then, now that he's full, \Nhow about a little patrol of his turf? {lit: inspection of the neighborhood area that's roped off }
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.88,0:01:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Bang!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.98,0:02:01.37,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Life as a city cat \Nseems quite stimulating and enjoyable.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.37,0:02:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Yowler! Long time no see.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.96,0:02:07.29,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Michael is known as Yowler at this shop. {unyanyan}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.80,0:02:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There was some leftover bread\N from the sandwiches, right? Bring it over here.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.87,0:02:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get hungry, come by anytime.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.00,0:02:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll let you eat as much as you want!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.21,0:02:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lickster? Good to see you. {Perorin}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.82,0:02:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.62,0:02:34.02,Narrator,,0,0,0,,At this shop, they call him Lickster.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.02,0:02:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him! \NLickster must've been very hungry.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.06,0:02:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's really pigging out on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.45,0:02:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter when you see him, \NLickster is cute every time.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.63,0:02:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? What's that smell?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.24,0:02:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! This ham is completely rotten!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.57,0:02:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Fancy that! We almost gave \N somebody food poisoning!{had \Nfood poisoning at our shop!}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.38,0:03:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Can't you even tell \Nwhen food's gone bad?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.55,0:03:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Lickster'll be okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.19,0:03:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.74,0:03:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.16,0:04:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Catherine! \NI told you not to leave your waste there! {??? soso can mean "pour in liquid/wet something/pee yourself" but from the context it must be michael's poo that she found so idk}　{sosou does apply to poo too}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.08,0:04:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.43,0:04:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Catherine!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.92,0:04:13.59,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Looks like Michael's stomach \Nis back to normal now. {refreshed}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.54,0:04:35.08,Narrator,,0,0,0,,City life was, for Michael, perfectly carefree.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.73,0:04:40.23,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? \NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.23,0:04:42.91,Song,,0,0,0,,You too will be number one someday
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.91,0:04:46.52,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael?\NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.52,0:04:49.52,Song,,0,0,0,,Now which one is number one?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.52,0:04:55.30,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? Number one!\NWhat's Michael? Number one!
Comment: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - Michael the Businessman}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.97,0:05:07.84,Narrator,,0,0,0,,A day in the life of businessman Michael
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.84,0:05:12.98,Narrator,,0,0,0,,is filled with the sorrows of a man \Nliving in a harsh competitive society.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.82,0:05:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, I've gotta hurry.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.99,0:05:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, not this one.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.80,0:05:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'm going to be late again...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.90,0:05:38.34,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And so begins another day \Nfor businessman Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.79,0:05:42.58,Thought,,0,0,0,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.58,0:05:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuwatch! {ultraman's cry}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.32,0:05:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, \NI had to skip breakfast.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.32,0:05:55.94,Top,,0,0,0,,This train will stop for five minutes \Nto let an express pass. {?} {sounds good}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.31,0:06:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bonito-flake soba.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.56,0:06:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dog food rice, make it quick.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.76,0:06:05.82,Narrator,,0,0,0,,That's Shinnosuke, who works \Nat the rival Dog Trading Company.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.47,0:06:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, your orders. {thanks for waiting}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.72,0:06:16.74,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Businessman Michael had forgotten one thing—\Ncats' tongues can't handle hot food.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.74,0:06:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.41,0:06:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come again!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.85,0:06:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Going first!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.32,0:06:30.79,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Michael works here at Cat Trading Company.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.96,0:06:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael-kun, as head of sales, \Nhow could you be late?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.20,0:06:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.22,0:06:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll let it slide today.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.08,0:06:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a seat. \NThere's something I want you to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.28,0:06:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,According to our info, Dog Trading is about to release a groundbreaking new product.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.88,0:06:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We absolutely need to find out \Nwhat it is beforehand.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.55,0:07:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm assigning that task to you, Michael-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.41,0:07:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop pacing sideways \Nand think up a proper strategy!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.08,0:07:17.31,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The following Sunday, \Nbusinessman Michael took Shinnosuke
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.31,0:07:22.11,Narrator,,0,0,0,,from Dog Trading's sales department \Nout for a round of corporate-entertainment golf.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.11,0:07:24.61,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The plan, of course, \Nwas to butter Shinnosuke up
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.61,0:07:28.12,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and extract information \Nabout the new product. But...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.68,0:07:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Catherine. \NNice to meet you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.29,0:07:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... L-Let's just get started.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.32,0:07:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.64,0:07:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice shot!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.17,0:07:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, out of bounds.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.07,0:07:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you can always re-hit.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.71,0:07:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll go next.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.32,0:08:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Very nice, Michael-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.12,0:08:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, j-just a fluke.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.89,0:08:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Shinnosuke, please re-hit.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.69,0:08:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this time for sure...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.64,0:08:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice shot!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.01,0:08:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a bunker.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.00,0:08:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that one really flew.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.51,0:08:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Very nicely done, Shinnosuke-san.\N Anyone would think you're a pro golfer.{believing chatgpt, don't care to learn golf for this; まるでシングルプレーヤーのショットですよ} {single player apparently means good golfers capable of consistently performing with just single-digit handicap. the idea is he's buttering up shinnosuke by saying something similar to the vein of'wow, that shot is so good, just like a pro(in this case, a single player)'}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.22,0:08:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, not really...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.95,0:08:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not many people can hit it that far. Amazing.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.16,0:08:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.95,0:08:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,One hundred fifty yards left.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.79,0:09:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was impressive, \NMichael-kun! Nice one.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.22,0:09:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, just another fluke, Shinnosuke-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.23,0:09:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this time for sure...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.79,0:09:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.90,0:09:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, gee...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.63,0:09:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight shot! Hit it strong.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.27,0:09:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There, it's going in!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.04,0:09:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.01,0:09:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, {\i1}now{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}it goes in!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.03,0:10:32.37,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{The results of sacrificing businessman Michael's \Nday off for corporate golf were zero.} Businessman Michael sacrificed his \N day off and had nothing to show for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.37,0:10:37.29,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The game fell apart, and he never got any information about the new product.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.29,0:10:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Come again sometime.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.94,0:10:45.66,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And so, the next day,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.66,0:10:50.42,Narrator,,0,0,0,,businessman Michael jostles in another perpetually packed commuter train to the office.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.42,0:10:56.66,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This is the true state of the modern salaryman \Nliving in a harsh competitive society.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:10:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(0,0)\p1\c&H080E0E&}m 0 0 l 640 0 640 480 0 480{\p0}
Comment: 0,0:10:59.14,0:10:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - I Hate Baths}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.08,0:11:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do this.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.02,0:11:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.72,0:11:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.33,0:11:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, come here...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.69,0:11:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.25,0:11:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, he figured it out already? \NCome back here!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.74,0:11:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm washing you today, like it or not!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.78,0:11:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.48,0:11:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can escape\Nin a place this small?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.50,0:11:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, where are you? \NHiding won't help!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.75,0:12:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So {\i1}there{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}you are!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.37,0:12:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Oops, wrong one.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.53,0:12:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, hiding the cat will just cause problem. {??? lit: doing secrecy; keeping secret won't be of help - no clue if she's talking about them and cat or them between themselves or what she means} {honestly sounds like the cat}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.53,0:12:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.93,0:12:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The deadline's coming up, \Nso everyone's on edge.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.37,0:12:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give us another headache. {lit: don't confuse our heads}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.88,0:12:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.11,0:12:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.62,0:12:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You really like to make this difficult, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.12,0:12:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too bad you're such a sore loser, \Nbut you'll have to prepare yourself! {not knowing when to give up; being a bad loser}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.06,0:12:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing dead won't work!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.23,0:12:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, in we go.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.26,0:12:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I put on a helmet just for this sort of thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.66,0:13:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.78,0:13:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello! Is Sensei in?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.82,0:13:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How are... whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.02,0:13:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimwit! Why did you\N open the door for him?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.72,0:13:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.36,0:13:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.71,0:13:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop! {??} {just stop, good as it is}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.61,0:13:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.60,0:13:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Koeda-san, hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.10,0:13:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.08,0:13:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.52,0:13:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.58,0:13:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.58,0:13:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.98,0:13:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.80,0:13:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I won't let you get away!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.90,0:13:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.76,0:14:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you escape, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.55,0:14:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.99,0:14:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere left for you to run!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.69,0:14:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, does shampoo \Nscare you even more than a dog?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.69,0:14:21.60,Thought,,0,0,0,,What's going on...?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.60,0:14:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't scream like I'm skinning you alive!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.10,0:14:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.07,0:14:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.41,0:14:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The longer you struggle, \Nthe longer we're staying here! {lit: if you don't behave, it won't amount to anything - meaning "I won't be able to finish bathing you" - idk how to make that sound ambiguous so isono could mistakenly think it's addressed to him}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.54,0:14:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you understand \Nwhat "stay still" means?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.94,0:14:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, why do you hate bathing so much? {shampoo }
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.79,0:14:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you were here? {in the hallway}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.32,0:14:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't notice at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.94,0:14:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring some tea right out.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.56,0:14:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking the manuscript, then. \NThanks, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.48,0:15:03.57,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But the day of terror wasn't over yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.57,0:15:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, dinner's ready!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.64,0:15:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, coming.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.74,0:15:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Curry tonight?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.65,0:15:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.32,0:15:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Michael, sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.22,0:15:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.29,0:15:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.69,0:15:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll have to bathe you all over again. {shampoo}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.15,0:15:36.86,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? \NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.86,0:15:39.36,Song,,0,0,0,,You too will be number one someday
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.36,0:15:42.90,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael?\NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.90,0:15:45.97,Song,,0,0,0,,Now which one is number one?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.97,0:15:51.89,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? Number one!\NWhat's Michael? Number one!
Comment: 0,0:15:53.17,0:15:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{Chapter - Catzilla for Sale}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.30,0:16:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Catherine...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.10,0:16:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Catherine, dear, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.94,0:16:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all because I went \Nand accepted this kind of job.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.58,0:16:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Living apart from you for a whole week... \NI wonder if I can stand it!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.65,0:16:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so stupid! I never should've taken a drama shoot in America.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.95,0:16:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, if you don't hurry, \Nyou'll miss your flight.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.12,0:16:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.68,0:16:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Catherine, if you get lonely while I'm gone,\N be a good girl and bear with it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.38,0:16:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, please take good care of her.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.94,0:16:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My Catherine is very delicate, \Nso watch what you feed her.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.35,0:16:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood. \NI'll treasure her more than my own life.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.81,0:16:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Catherine.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.81,0:16:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come get you in a week, first thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.82,0:17:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Catherine!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.13,0:17:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.63,0:17:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh right, a new cat should've arrived.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.43,0:17:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Now which was which cat? {lit: which basket was it - but I couldn't resist forcing in a quote from CATS; it will happen again}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.38,0:17:27.90,Thought,,0,0,0,,My Catherine is very delicate...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.11,0:17:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, they've sent me one heck of a cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.40,0:17:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I can sell it even at that price?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.13,0:17:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, which shop should we check out? {you wanna go to?} {??} {not 100% sure either but should be fine}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.20,0:17:46.43,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.27,0:17:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! What a cute kitty!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.11,0:17:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.61,0:17:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wanna go inside?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.98,0:18:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's. If we see a cute enough cat, \NI might even buy and keep it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.05,0:18:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all so cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.28,0:18:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But also expensive.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.50,0:18:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course they are! \NThey're all high-class kittens.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.79,0:18:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister, don't you have \Nany cheaper kittens?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.71,0:18:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, in that case, you might like this one.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.89,0:18:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a rare breed, and only 1,000 yen!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.18,0:18:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What, really? Only 1,000 yen?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.50,0:18:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.50,0:18:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A rare breed for 1,000 yen? \NMaybe I'll keep it myself!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.00,0:18:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll keep one too. {???} {accurate}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.68,0:18:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So, did you like it?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.55,0:18:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, I think I'll still play it safe \Nand go with a chinchilla or something.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.72,0:18:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.07,0:18:45.86,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The next day...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.86,0:18:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how cute! \NThis one's a Persian.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.93,0:18:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And this one's a Siamese.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.86,0:18:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind the next one is.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.24,0:18:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was a Catzilla, huh... {?}{sounds like a made up word, can go with that or something like 'this one is... something...'}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.48,0:19:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there! Mommy's sorry \Nshe showed you something like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.78,0:19:08.32,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{After three days.} On the third day.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.12,0:19:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, ma'am?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.66,0:19:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that monster doing here?! {??????? no clue, something about a good head?} {not sure about this either, searched around and doesn't seem like old lady speak nor accents, might be okay to keep as is, or include reference to big head}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.46,0:19:24.73,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{After five days.} On the fifth day.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.73,0:19:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.30,0:19:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, welcome.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.83,0:19:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take ten cans of cat food.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.60,0:19:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Any particular brand?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.07,0:19:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Anything's fine \Nas long as it tastes good.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.41,0:19:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.01,0:19:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Is this a tanuki? {raccoon dog} {imatu: I switched these; anyone watching this probs knows what a tanuki is}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.02,0:19:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's a cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.02,0:19:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A... cat?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.36,0:19:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take that cat off my hands,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.19,0:19:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll throw in these cans for free.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.50,0:20:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but nope. \NHow much is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.72,0:20:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see... That'll be exactly 1,000 yen.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.44,0:20:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.66,0:20:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed \Nto sell this thing any cheaper? {put a price on}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.50,0:20:18.52,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{One week passed.} It's been one week.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.76,0:20:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Catherine! Catherine!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.79,0:20:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, she's been doing just fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.00,0:20:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.20,0:20:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this? \NThat's not my Catherine-chan at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.32,0:20:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What? No way...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.59,0:20:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You! What did you do with my Catherine? \NSpeak up now!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.79,0:20:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything at all happened to Catherine, \NI'll make sure you regret it!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.71,0:20:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Catherine!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.82,0:20:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Catherine, you've gotten so thin... \NCome on, let's go home now.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.13,0:21:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There sure are things \NI don't understand in this world...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.60,0:21:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you playing at?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.31,0:21:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Puppy-dog eyes won't help you. {lit: even if you flash your cuteness}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.31,0:21:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to sell you either. \NNow run along, okay?
Comment: 0,0:21:20.60,0:21:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,
